  {
    "id": "bfd07eda-d2c9-4535-be53-079bceb1b9e6",
    "question": "Built real Create Promotion feature (fixed a dead button), credited Promotion Types",
    "answer": "Found the admin coupons page had a real list+transition UI (GET /api/coupons, PATCH for state transitions) backed by a rich Coupon.ts domain class, but the '+ New Coupon' button had literally zero onClick handler and no POST route existed anywhere -- coupons could never actually be created (found live 2026-09-02). Built POST /api/coupons (constructs a real Coupon domain object for validation before insert, starts at draft) + NewCouponForm modal wired to the previously-dead button. Verified live: domain validation correctly rejects a >100% percentage discount, real INSERT matches the GET route's exact query shape, real duplicate-code unique-constraint correctly rejects a repeat code, confirmed 401, cleaned up test data, tsc clean. Flipped Create Promotion to real. Also credited Promotion Types (coupon_type's real 19-value CHECK constraint, selectable in the new form). Left Price Calculation Example/Flow, Price List Concept/Screen, Price Rule Hierarchy, Pricing Context not_built -- all tied to PricingRule.ts's hierarchy/context classes, confirmed dead (imported for one constant only) earlier this session. Registry now: 402 real / 470 not_built / 41 partial / 26 n_a / 1 blocked.",
