    "question": "SEO/GEO domain: 3rd item -- Keyword Intelligence (real Google Suggest data)",
    "answer": "Built src/domain/seo/KeywordIntelligence.ts using the real free Google Suggest autocomplete API for related-keyword data, cross-checked against real page content -- explicitly does NOT fabricate volume/difficulty scores (needs a paid API this project lacks). Verified live: real query for 'yoga classes' against the real /services page found a genuine content gap (9 of 10 related local-search terms missing). Domain now 5 real / 3 partial / 11 not_built (was 2/3/14 at session start -- 3 real items shipped this session: Schema Generator, Broken Link & Redirect Management, Keyword Intelligence).",
