  {
    "id": "a86fe560-eced-43b5-b9d0-6c0221e4e8b5",
    "question": "SEO/GEO domain: 4th item -- Internal Linking Engine, real bug caught+fixed during verification",
    "answer": "Built src/domain/seo/InternalLinkingEngine.ts + GET /api/admin/seo/internal-linking + full UI on /admin/seo-checker. Real keyword-overlap analysis across the site's own real pages, no ML/LLM. First verification pass surfaced an honest bug: shared nav/footer boilerplate words (home, skip, soham) were polluting the 'topical relevance' signal since every page shares them. Fixed by filtering words appearing on 60%+ of pages before computing overlap -- re-verified live, now shows genuinely topical matches (postures, alignment, flexibility, gentle) between /services, /about and the 3 yoga-style subpages. Domain now 6 real / 3 partial / 10 not_built (started this session at 2/3/14 -- 4 real items shipped: Schema Generator, Broken Link & Redirect Management, Keyword Intelligence, Internal Linking Engine).",
