    "question": "SEO/GEO domain: 6th and 7th items -- SEO Issue Prioritization + Multi-Location Management",
    "answer": "Built SEO Issue Prioritization (aggregates the 4 already-real checkers into one severity-ranked list, verified live: 11 real issues found on /services). Built Multi-Location Management (full CRUD over the real branch table + admin UI at /admin/locations, nav entry added) -- this is the exact table that had been empty all session, causing Schema Generator/Local SEO Checker to report address/phone as missing. Verified with a genuine cross-feature test: created a real branch row, confirmed Schema Generator immediately picked it up with zero missing fields, then cleaned up the test row. Domain now 9 real / 3 partial / 7 not_built (session start: 2/3/14 -- 7 real items shipped this session).",
