  {
    "id": "2474b083-2271-4400-a4ed-d239761654e5",
    "question": "SEO/GEO domain: 8th item -- Reviews to Local SEO, session summary",
    "answer": "Built ReviewSeoSignal.ts joining the existing real business_review/reputation pipeline to compute aggregateRating for schema.org output. Verified with temporary real-shaped test data (2 reviews, 5-star+4-star -> correctly computed 4.5 avg), cleaned up after. Domain now 10 real / 3 partial / 6 not_built (session start: 2/3/14). 8 real SEO/GEO items shipped this session: Schema Generator, Broken Link & Redirect Management, Keyword Intelligence, Internal Linking Engine, Topic Cluster/Content Hub, SEO Issue Prioritization, Multi-Location Management, Reviews to Local SEO. 2 real bugs caught and fixed during live verification (boilerplate word pollution, transitive cluster over-merge). Full type-check clean across all new code (only 3 pre-existing unrelated test errors in ClassSequence.test.ts remain, untouched). Remaining 6 not_built (Customer Self-Service SEO Management, Keyword Opportunity Score, Local Landing Page Factory, Local Search Conversion, SEO Architecture, SEO Content Brief) -- Keyword Opportunity Score and Local Search Conversion genuinely need paid third-party APIs (search-volume/attribution data) this project has no credentials for.",
