  {
    "id": "1e7f93a9-35e9-48fd-bd45-af58c0fa2206",
    "question": "SEO/GEO domain COMPLETE except 2 genuinely credential-blocked items: 2/3/14 -> 14 real / 3 partial / 2 not_built",
    "answer": "Finished the SEO + LOCAL SEO + AI SEARCH / GEO MANAGEMENT domain backlog this session. Final 3 items built: Customer Self-Service SEO Management (real finding: requireAdmin already accepted Editor/Sales roles at the API layer -- the only gap was an over-restrictive nav requiredRoles:[Admin], fixed to match the existing [Admin,Editor] precedent already used elsewhere in admin/layout.tsx), SEO Architecture (real URL-depth/H1-uniqueness crawler, verified live: 10 pages, 0 issues), SEO Content Brief (grounded in real Google Suggest data, no fabricated word-count target), Local Landing Page Factory (deterministic templating over branch x service_master, verified BOTH the honest-empty-state path (0 pages, tables are really empty) AND the happy path with temporary real test data, cleaned up after). Domain went from 2 real/3 partial/14 not_built at session start to 14 real/3 partial/2 not_built. The 2 remaining not_built (Keyword Opportunity Score, Local Search Conversion) genuinely need paid third-party APIs (search-volume/competition data, attribution/analytics tracking) this project has zero credentials for -- explicitly left not_built rather than fabricated. Total this session: 11 real SEO/GEO features shipped, all live-verified against real data (not demos), 2 real bugs caught and fixed during verification (boilerplate-word pollution in Internal Linking Engine, transitive over-merge in Topic Cluster Engine), full tsc clean throughout (only 3 pre-existing unrelated ClassSequence.test.ts errors remain, never touched).",
